      "description": "Root cause. Vulnerable `get_supported_gost_curve()` aliases `GNUTLS_ECC_CURVE_GOST256CPA`, `GNUTLS_ECC_CURVE_GOST256CPXA`, and `GNUTLS_ECC_CURVE_GOST256B` to the locally-built legacy `nettle_get_gost_256cpa()` backport. That local object is later consumed by external Nettle with an incompatible `struct ecc_curve` layout."
